WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.585
Got your kit?

00:00:01.585 --> 00:00:06.957
Check your pickup window, then follow the instructions that came with it.

00:00:06.957 --> 00:00:11.394
Make sure the container's sealed and its code matches the app.

00:00:11.394 --> 00:00:15.652
Only confirm collection when you're ready to hand it over.

00:00:15.652 --> 00:00:20.711
In this demo, that starts the courier simulation and a sixty-minute timer

00:00:20.711 --> 00:00:22.670
for lab receipt.

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:27.028
One thing to remember: the app's checklist doesn't replace your kit

00:00:27.028 --> 00:00:30.000
instructions.
